1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:06,400
To write one token, Llama 3.1 8B does
15.5 billion operations.

2
00:00:07,417 --> 00:00:10,767
More than 99.9% of them are this.

3
00:00:11,383 --> 00:00:15,908
Multiply two lists position by
position, then add up the results.

4
00:00:16,208 --> 00:00:18,008
That's a dot product.

5
00:00:19,017 --> 00:00:21,667
A twelve-year-old can do one on paper.

6
00:00:21,967 --> 00:00:28,392
An LLM does billions of them, which is where
those 15.5 billion operations go.
